# ── How secrets reach the server ─────────────────────────────────
# The .NET backend reads config from appsettings.json, overridden by
# environment variables. Set the equivalent env vars in Render (or any
# host). Both the PayMongo and Email values below are REQUIRED in
# production — appsettings.json ships with them empty.
#
# Local development uses appsettings.Development.json (gitignored), so
# you do NOT need to export these locally.

# ── PayMongo API Keys (test: sk_test_/pk_test_, live: sk_live_/pk_live_) ──
PayMongo__SecretKey=sk_test_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
PayMongo__PublicKey=pk_test_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
PayMongo__ApiBaseUrl=https://api.paymongo.com
PayMongo__WebhookSecretKey=whsk_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# ── SMTP Email (Brevo relay) ───────────────────────────────
# NOTE: Render free tier blocks outbound SMTP ports 25/465/587.
# Use Brevo on port 2525 so email works on free Render.
Email__Host=smtp-relay.brevo.com
Email__Port=2525
Email__Username=b94070001@smtp-brevo.com
Email__Password=xsmtpsib-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
Email__FromAddress=you@gmail.com
Email__FromName=TravelConnect

# ── Database (SQL Server) ─────────────────────────────────────
# ConnectionStrings__TravelConnect=Server=...;Database=...;User Id=...;Password=...;TrustServerCertificate=True;MultipleActiveResultSets=True;

# ── Authentication / CORS ─────────────────────────────────────
# Authentication__FirebaseProjectId=travelconnect-d89ce
# Comma-separated origin override (leave unset to use appsettings.json list):
# Cors__AllowedOrigins__0=https://your-app.vercel.app